  "revision": "Revised after first run (quick pass 2026-11-03): shared domain-base defects fixed in the cases, approver_role schema fact and the CH09/CV01-CV04 boundary added to the rulebook. Revision 2 after quick pass 2 (2026-11-04): rule-by-rule audit of all four bases, allowed data classes in the rulebook (lint-checked). Revision 3 after quick pass 3 (2026-11-05): class order, factory caps and the output-field definition in the rulebook; K01 and K16 reworked where the plant was arguable; three missed base defects fixed; critic instructions tuned (field-by-field check, CH09 boundary, CH14/CH15 scope). Revision 4 after quick pass 4 (2026-11-05): K29 reworked where the CH04 plant was arguable; K05 key expects CH11 only; bike refusals say where a refused form goes; K10/K27 AC01 given a verb; rulebook: examples judged on content, CH09 boundary in its own row, schema field names never CH14. See the build log."
